{"id":1083,"slug":"dodes-ka-den","title":"Dodes’ka-den","year":1970,"country":"Japan","duration":144,"spine":465,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/1083-dodes-ka-den","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/6bd0c9b65e7ea198e3eaa2f8155f8936/pFvySgxCKaSto7o69vmvh6Goar0cc9_large.jpg","description":"By turns tragic and transcendent, Akira Kurosawa’s film follows the daily lives of a group of people barely scraping by in a slum on the outskirts of Tokyo. Yet as desperate as their circumstances are, each of them—the homeless father and son envisioning their dream house; the young woman abused by her uncle; the boy who imagines himself a trolley conductor—finds reasons to carry on. The unforgettable Dodes’ka-den was made at a tumultuous moment in Kurosawa's life. And all of his hopes, fears, and artistic passion are on fervent display in this, his gloriously shot first color film.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Akira Kurosawa","slug":"akira-kurosawa"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Yoshitaka Zushi","role":"Rokkuchan","slug":"yoshitaka-zushi"},{"actor":"Kin Sugai","role":"Rokkuchan's mother","slug":"kin-sugai"},{"actor":"Junzaburo Ban","role":"Shima","slug":"junzaburo-ban"},{"actor":"Kiyoko Tange","role":"Shima’s wife","slug":"kiyoko-tange"},{"actor":"Hisashi Igawa","role":"Masuda","slug":"hisashi-igawa"},{"actor":"Hideko Okiyama","role":"Tatsu, Masuda’s wife","slug":"hideko-okiyama"},{"actor":"Kunie Tanaka","role":"Kawaguchi","slug":"kunie-tanaka"},{"actor":"Jitsuko Yoshimura","role":"Yoshiko, Kawaguchi’s wife","slug":"jitsuko-yoshimura"},{"actor":"Shinsuke Minami","role":"Ryo Sawagami","slug":"shinsuke-minami"},{"actor":"Yoko Kusunoki","role":"Sawagami’s wife","slug":"yoko-kusunoki"},{"actor":"Noboru Mitani","role":"Beggar","slug":"noboru-mitani"},{"actor":"Hiroyuki Kawase","role":"Beggar’s son","slug":"hiroyuki-kawase"},{"actor":"Hiroshi Akutagawa","role":"Hei","slug":"hiroshi-akutagawa"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Akira Kurosawa